{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 20</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"1982_AHSME_Problems.2FProblem_20\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\">1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 20</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: 1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of pairs of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> which satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/6/3d6527ba16706ababc980404f8f8bdb9d3216577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=x^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d87e357e7e161e1e6e9b3b652ec308e9151b96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A)} 0 \\qquad  \\text {(B)} 1 \\qquad  \\text {(C)} 2 \\qquad  \\text {(D)} \\text{not finite} \\qquad  \\text {(E)} \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"446\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearrange the equation to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1da7377d947410f6feb803e1ffb43330c8663e7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2=x^3-x^2=x^2(x-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"195\" height=\"19\" />. This equation is satisfied whenever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> is a perfect square. There are infinite possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca15a1657fe687c35817c35b88f619d460fcfe52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D: \\text{Not Finite}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME\" title=\"1982 AHSME\">1982 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1982 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b>